{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2023-04-13 17:00:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.45 PER ORDINARY SHARE OF THE COMPANY. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 30, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 15, 2023. ABOUT ALLEGION ALLEGION (NYSE: ALLE) IS A GLOBAL PIONEER IN SEAMLESS ACCESS, WITH LEADING BRANDS LIKE CISA®, INTERFLEX®, LCN®, SCHLAGE®, SIMONSVOSS® AND VON DUPRIN®.'}